answer.type/math :answer/value "\\pi " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-5d9a9574-0239-56b9-b74c-601d7849c71e" :answer-field/id #uuid "5d9a9574-0239-56b9-b74c-601d7849c71e" :answer-field/key "field-5" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-23c8fc31-c04a-55f3-b418-822b94320b8c" :answer-field/choices ["answer-75e4dbf3-e378-5ec2-b8a5-728fcdded53e" "answer-23c8fc31-c04a-55f3-b418-822b94320b8c" "answer-e5cf8d32-cee9-5c3c-b38e-722ea6242159" "answer-d3fa551c-7c0f-5dfe-b113-eb5fc2945fba" "answer-ee7adb66-75f9-5881-bfab-6bca6145d34a" "answer-8df6ab7c-533c-5677-9af6-8b7e905bd55a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-75e4dbf3-e378-5ec2-b8a5-728fcdded53e" :answer/id #uuid "75e4dbf3-e378-5ec2-b8a5-728fcdded53e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-2\\pi }^{2\\pi }x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{7}{2}x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-23c8fc31-c04a-55f3-b418-822b94320b8c" :answer/id #uuid "23c8fc31-c04a-55f3-b418-822b94320b8c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-2\\pi }^{2\\pi }x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{7}{2}x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e5cf8d32-cee9-5c3c-b38e-722ea6242159" :answer/id #uuid "e5cf8d32-cee9-5c3c-b38e-722ea6242159" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-7}^{7}x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(7\\pi x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d3fa551c-7c0f-5dfe-b113-eb5fc2945fba" :answer/id #uuid "d3fa551c-7c0f-5dfe-b113-eb5fc2945fba" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-7}^{7}x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(7\\pi x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ee7adb66-75f9-5881-bfab-6bca6145d34a" :answer/id #uuid "ee7adb66-75f9-5881-bfab-6bca6145d34a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }x\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8df6ab7c-533c-5677-9af6-8b7e905bd55a" :answer/id #uuid "8df6ab7c-533c-5677-9af6-8b7e905bd55a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{7L}{\\pi }x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-fb364528-cf72-5941-b3b8-fc021ca9ace0" :question/id #uuid "fb364528-cf72-5941-b3b8-fc021ca9ace0" :question/math-academy-id "q-341777" :question/problem "Let $f(x)$ be the $2L$-periodic extension of a function $F(x)$ from $x\\in [-L,L)$ to $x\\in R.$\nSelect the correct options in the reasoning below.\n\nThe Fourier series of $f$ is given by\n\n$$\nf(x)∼\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡({{field-1}})+{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡({{field-2}}).\n$$\n\nThe $6$th cosine coefficient of the series is\n\n$$\n{a}_{6}={{field-3}}.\n$$\n\nGiven that $F(x)={e}^{-{x}^{2}}$ and $L=5,$ the $6$th cosine coefficient becomes\n\n$$\n{a}_{6}={{field-4}}\\,\\cdot \\,{{field-5}}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that multiplying the argument of a function by $k\\ne 0$ represents the horizontal stretching of the corresponding graph by a factor of $\\frac{1}{k}.$\n\nNow, let $s=\\frac{\\pi }{L}x.$ Then, since $f(x)$ has a period of $2L,$ the function\n\n$$\ng(s)=f(\\frac{L}{\\pi }s)\n$$\n\nmust have a period of $2L\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{L}=2\\pi .$ \n\nThe Fourier series of $g(s)$ is\n\n$$\ng(s)∼\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(ns)+{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(ns),\n$$\n\nwhere:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{0} & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }g(s)\\,\\text{d}s \\\\ {a}_{n} & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }g(s)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(ns)\\,\\text{d}s,\\,n\\ge 1 \\\\ {b}_{n} & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }g(s)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(ns)\\,\\text{d}s,\\,n\\ge 1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting $s=\\frac{\\pi }{L}x$ and using the fact that $g(s)=f(\\frac{L}{\\pi }s),$ we get the Fourier series of $f(x):$\n\n$$\nf(x)∼\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi }{L}x)+{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi }{L}x)\n$$\n\nTherefore, $6$th cosine coefficient of $f(x)$ is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{6} & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }g(s)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(6s)\\,\\text{d}s \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }f(\\frac{L}{\\pi }s)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(6s)\\,\\text{d}s \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-L}^{L}f(\\frac{L}{\\pi }\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{L}x)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(6\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{L}x)\\,\\text{d}(\\frac{\\pi }{L}x) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{L}{\\int }_{-L}^{L}f(x)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{6\\pi }{L}x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{L}{\\int }_{-L}^{L}f(x)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{6\\pi }{L}x)\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting $L=5$ and $f(x)={e}^{-{x}^{2}},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{6} & =\\frac{1}{5}\\cdot {\\int }_{-5}^{5}{e}^{-{x}^{2}}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{6\\pi }{5}x)\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-91327f8b-24a5-5a14-b72f-dc506b7dc1e0" "answer-field-27849c49-d7ae-5d00-af0d-9052f43cd943" "answer-field-85d4ff48-5bff-577d-8fcc-6da194224b88" "answer-field-20357d5e-1bc8-5dd7-8db6-94cde34f7b98" "answer-field-f064fef8-a113-5d06-b95a-f4c517e2b24e"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-91327f8b-24a5-5a14-b72f-dc506b7dc1e0" :answer-field/id #uuid "91327f8b-24a5-5a14-b72f-dc506b7dc1e0" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-09a4dbf4-935c-5e5a-bfc2-9a1676fbd5fb" :answer-field/choices ["answer-12dbb8fc-f8ae-55a2-b4d3-f92953f9c8be" "answer-408b0c9c-4d17-5e7b-b2fd-1a3711a49bcf" "answer-09a4dbf4-935c-5e5a-bfc2-9a1676fbd5fb" "answer-6e149a08-fca9-5755-a128-871a5e7f972a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-12dbb8fc-f8ae-55a2-b4d3-f92953f9c8be" :answer/id #uuid "12dbb8fc-f8ae-55a2-b4d3-f92953f9c8be" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{L}{n\\pi }x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-408b0c9c-4d17-5e7b-b2fd-1a3711a49bcf" :answer/id #uuid "408b0c9c-4d17-5e7b-b2fd-1a3711a49bcf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{nL}{\\pi }x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-09a4dbf4-935c-5e5a-bfc2-9a1676fbd5fb" :answer/id #uuid "09a4dbf4-935c-5e5a-bfc2-9a1676fbd5fb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{n\\pi }{L}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6e149a08-fca9-5755-a128-871a5e7f972a" :answer/id #uuid "6e149a08-fca9-5755-a128-871a5e7f972a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{n}{L\\pi }x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-27849c49-d7ae-5d00-af0d-9052f43cd943" :answer-field/id #uuid "27849c49-d7ae-5d00-af0d-9052f43cd943" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-dcf2f238-55a6-5eba-aab4-593b9d230174" :answer-field/choices ["answer-9759635c-2ad3-53f5-bf90-188ab5ee89fc" "answer-2cb1d5d8-50ce-55bc-914f-d72f4e722ac9" "answer-dcf2f238-55a6-5eba-aab4-593b9d230174" "answer-08c1423b-4b36-5a57-af95-274f05349530"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9759635c-2ad3-53f5-bf90-188ab5ee89fc" :answer/id #uuid "9759635c-2ad3-53f5-bf90-188ab5ee89fc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{L}{n\\pi }x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2cb1d5d8-50ce-55bc-914f-d72f4e722ac9" :answer/id #uuid "2cb1d5d8-50ce-55bc-914f-d72f4e722ac9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{nL}{\\pi }x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-dcf2f238-55a6-5eba-aab4-593b9d230174" :answer/id #uuid "dcf2f238-55a6-5eba-aab4-593b9d230174" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{n\\pi }{L}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-08c1423b-4b36-5a57-af95-274f05349530" :answer/id #uuid "08c1423b-4b36-5a57-af95-274f05349530" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{n}{L\\pi }x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-85d4ff48-5bff-577d-8fcc-6da194224b88" :answer-field/id #uuid "85d4ff48-5bff-577d-8fcc-6da194224b88" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-bd4313e4-396a-522f-ac91-2fe946177c85" :answer-field/choices ["answer-301c2ad4-c129-5368-a4e7-f5b0d56d72e2" "answer-bd4313e4-396a-522f-ac91-2fe946177c85" "answer-3772f1bf-2be9-5fde-a6f3-a10daf474041" "answer-3460cb96-cb5c-51f8-8067-777cfcdc2e0c" "answer-709638e2-6f52-5672-bc08-7272530d466a" "answer-8e5f06f7-2394-5626-a339-dc35edddd589"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-301c2ad4-c129-5368-a4e7-f5b0d56d72e2" :answer/id #uuid "301c2ad4-c129-5368-a4e7-f5b0d56d72e2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{L}{\\int }_{-L}^{L}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-bd4313e4-396a-522f-ac91-2fe946177c85" :answer/id #uuid "bd4313e4-396a-522f-ac91-2fe946177c85" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{L}{\\int }_{-L}^{L}f(x)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{6\\pi }{L}x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3772f1bf-2be9-5fde-a6f3-a10daf474041" :answer/id #uuid "3772f1bf-2be9-5fde-a6f3-a10daf474041" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{L}{\\int }_{-L}^{L}f(x)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{6\\pi }{L}x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3460cb96-cb5c-51f8-8067-777cfcdc2e0c" :answer/id #uuid "3460cb96-cb5c-51f8-8067-777cfcdc2e0c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }f(x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-709638e2-6f52-5672-bc08-7272530d466a" :answer/id #uuid "709638e2-6f52-5672-bc08-7272530d466a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }f(x)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{6L}{\\pi }x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8e5f06f7-2394-5626-a339-dc35edddd589" :answer/id #uuid "8e5f06f7-2394-5626-a339-dc35edddd589" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }f(x)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{6\\pi }{L}x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-20357d5e-1bc8-5dd7-8db6-94cde34f7b98" :answer-field/id #uuid "20357d5e-1bc8-5dd7-8db6-94cde34f7b98" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-23e03e47-e4e8-5fca-b00b-82be453f972c" :answer-field/choices ["answer-86c4360f-61c6-544f-837f-69869e0595be" "answer-23e03e47-e4e8-5fca-b00b-82be453f972c" "answer-a678a72c-346e-543b-a426-99936f3a21b6" "answer-cb286bc5-b920-5dea-9cb5-6caae099b3e3"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-86c4360f-61c6-544f-837f-69869e0595be" :answer/id #uuid "86c4360f-61c6-544f-837f-69869e0595be" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{5\\pi }" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-23e03e47-e4e8-5fca-b00b-82be453f972c" :answer/id #uuid "23e03e47-e4e8-5fca-b00b-82be453f972c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a678a72c-346e-543b-a426-99936f3a21b6" :answer/id #uuid "a678a72c-346e-543b-a426-99936f3a21b6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{\\pi }" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-cb286bc5-b920-5dea-9cb5-6caae099b3e3" :answer/id #uuid "cb286bc5-b920-5dea-9cb5-6caae099b3e3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{\\pi }" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-f064fef8-a113-5d06-b95a-f4c517e2b24e" :answer-field/id #uuid "f064fef8-a113-5d06-b95a-f4c517e2b24e" :answer-field/key "field-5" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-20a6260d-a64c-5771-b68c-fd4b972f15c7" :answer-field/choices ["answer-873e0942-50fd-5a7c-91e2-3b1957f1bed0" "answer-20a6260d-a64c-5771-b68c-fd4b972f15c7" "answer-23121dd1-c0fc-5a11-a114-b71f188cf2bf" "answer-0b080894-e225-574e-b611-6de778384829" "answer-16362305-1448-5d7f-841f-42942c9f6ad0" "answer-84ff721d-5ea1-5783-b823-a370c88ce292"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-873e0942-50fd-5a7c-91e2-3b1957f1bed0" :answer/id #uuid "873e0942-50fd-5a7c-91e2-3b1957f1bed0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-5}^{5}{e}^{-{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-20a6260d-a64c-5771-b68c-fd4b972f15c7" :answer/id #uuid "20a6260d-a64c-5771-b68c-fd4b972f15c7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-5}^{5}{e}^{-{x}^{2}}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{6\\pi }{5}x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-23121dd1-c0fc-5a11-a114-b71f188cf2bf" :answer/id #uuid "23121dd1-c0fc-5a11-a114-b71f188cf2bf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-5}^{5}{e}^{-{x}^{2}}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{6\\pi }{5}x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0b080894-e225-574e-b611-6de778384829" :answer/id #uuid "0b080894-e225-574e-b611-6de778384829" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }{e}^{-{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-16362305-1448-5d7f-841f-42942c9f6ad0" :answer/id #uuid "16362305-1448-5d7f-841f-42942c9f6ad0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }{e}^{-{x}^{2}}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(6x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-84ff721d-5ea1-5783-b823-a370c88ce292" :answer/id #uuid "84ff721d-5ea1-5783-b823-a370c88ce292" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }{e}^{-{x}^{2}}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(6x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-bc08f5e3-6f0e-55df-87af-7552a06bb9df" :question/id #uuid "bc08f5e3-6f0e-55df-87af-7552a06bb9df" :question/math-academy-id "q-341802" :question/problem "$$\nf(x)∼\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi }{2}x)+{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi }{2}x)\n$$\n\nLet $F(x)=-3x+3$ for $x\\in [-2,2).$ The Fourier series of the $4$-periodic extension $f(x)$ of $F(x)$ is shown above. Find the exact value of ${a}_{0}.$\n\n${a}_{0}=$ {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "For the Fourier series of a $2L$-periodic function, the constant term is given by\n\n$$\n{a}_{0}=\\frac{1}{L}{\\int }_{-L}^{L}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nIn our case, $L=2$ and $f(x)=-3x+3$ for $x\\in [-2,2).$ So, substituting into the formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{0} & =\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{-2}^{2}(-3x+3)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}{[-\\frac{3}{2}{x}^{2}+3x]}_{-2}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}((-\\frac{3}{2}\\cdot {2}^{2}+3\\cdot 2)-(-\\frac{3}{2}\\cdot (-2)^{2}+3\\cdot (-2))) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(0-(-12)) \\\\  & =6.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-b3e4d068-52a7-54b2-9f52-ab0c0b143b6e"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-b3e4d068-52a7-54b2-9f52-ab0c0b143b6e" :answer-field/id #uuid "b3e4d068-52a7-54b2-9f52-ab0c0b143b6e" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-1f47cc34-1a40-54f8-8f21-1937b1207c8c" :answer-field/choices ["answer-1f47cc34-1a40-54f8-8f21-1937b1207c8c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1f47cc34-1a40-54f8-8f21-1937b1207c8c" :answer/id #uuid "1f47cc34-1a40-54f8-8f21-1937b1207c8c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-14280c74-af6e-5d18-9712-69501b60ddc5" :question/id #uuid "14280c74-af6e-5d18-9712-69501b60ddc5" :question/math-academy-id "q-341830" :question/problem "$$\nf(x)∼\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n}{2}x)+{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n}{2}x)\n$$\n\nThe Fourier series of the $4\\pi $-periodic extension $f(x)$ of the function \n\n$$\nF(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}5, & x\\in [0,2\\pi ) \\\\ -2, & x\\in [-2\\pi ,0)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nis shown above. Find the exact value of ${b}_{3}.$\n\n${b}_{3}=$ {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "For the Fourier series of a $2L$-periodic function, the sine coefficients are given by\n\n$$\n{b}_{n}=\\frac{1}{L}{\\int }_{-L}^{L}f(x)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi }{L}x)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nIn our case, $L=2\\pi .$ Also, $f(x)=5$ for $x\\in [0,2\\pi )$ and $f(x)=-2$ for $x\\in [-2\\pi ,0).$ So, substituting into the formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{b}_{3} & =\\frac{1}{2\\pi }{\\int }_{-2\\pi }^{2\\pi }f(x)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{3}{2}x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2\\pi }{\\int }_{-2\\pi }^{0}(-2)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{3}{2}x)\\,\\text{d}x+\\frac{1}{2\\pi }{\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }5\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{3}{2}x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{2\\pi }\\cdot (-\\frac{2}{3}){[\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{3}{2}x)]}_{-2\\pi }^{0}+\\frac{5}{2\\pi }\\cdot (-\\frac{2}{3}){[\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{3}{2}x)]}_{0}^{2\\pi } \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{3\\pi }(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(0)-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(-3\\pi ))-\\frac{5}{3\\pi }(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3\\pi )-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(0)) \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{3\\pi }(1-(-1))-\\frac{5}{3\\pi }((-1)-1) \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{3\\pi }+\\frac{10}{3\\pi } \\\\  & =\\frac{14}{3\\pi }.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-50ebbed4-eb9c-5659-8b8c-f37f72666390"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-50ebbed4-eb9c-5659-8b8c-f37f72666390" :answer-field/id #uuid "50ebbed4-eb9c-5659-8b8c-f37f72666390" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-f308dd20-f66e-5ffb-861b-4ab8333e47b2" :answer-field/choices ["answer-f308dd20-f66e-5ffb-861b-4ab8333e47b2"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f308dd20-f66e-5ffb-861b-4ab8333e47b2" :answer/id #uuid "f308dd20-f66e-5ffb-861b-4ab8333e47b2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{14}{3\\pi}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-e5dc675f-f1b9-58e9-a567-64d8cd60aaaf" :question/id #uuid "e5dc675f-f1b9-58e9-a567-64d8cd60aaaf" :question/math-academy-id "q-341873" :question/problem "$$\nf(x)∼\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi }{3}x)+{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi }{3}x)\n$$\n\nLet $F(x)=2x+7$ for $x\\in [-3,3).$ The Fourier series of the $6$-periodic extension $f(x)$ of $F(x)$ is shown above. Find the exact value of ${a}_{1}.$\n\n${a}_{1}=$ {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "For the Fourier series of a $2L$-periodic function, the cosine coefficients are given by\n\n$$\n{a}_{n}=\\frac{1}{L}{\\int }_{-L}^{L}f(x)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi }{L}x)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nIn our case, $L=3$ and $f(x)=2x+7$ for $x\\in [-3,3).$ So, substituting into the formula, we get\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\frac{1}{3}{\\int }_{-3}^{3}(2x+7)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3}x)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe use the integration by parts: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=2x+7\\, & ⇒\\,{u}^{′}=2 \\\\ {v}^{′}=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3}x)\\, & ⇒\\,v=\\frac{3}{\\pi }\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3}x)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{1} & =\\frac{1}{3}(uv\\,{|}_{-3}^{3}-{\\int }_{-3}^{3}v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}(\\frac{3}{\\pi }{[(2x+7)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3}x)]}_{-3}^{3}-{\\int }_{-3}^{3}\\frac{3}{\\pi }\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3}x)\\cdot 2\\,\\text{d}x) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}(\\frac{3}{\\pi }[13\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi )-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(-\\pi )]-\\frac{6}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-3}^{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3}x)\\,\\text{d}x) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}(\\frac{3}{\\pi }\\cdot 0-\\frac{6}{\\pi }\\cdot (-\\frac{3}{\\pi }){[\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3}x)]}_{-3}^{3}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}(\\frac{18}{{\\pi }^{2}}[\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi )-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(-\\pi )]) \\\\  & =\\frac{6}{{\\pi }^{2}}(-1-(-1)) \\\\  & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-2afc926f-9cf1-5b4f-8748-f140b3012b4a"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-2afc926f-9cf1-5b4f-8748-f140b3012b4a" :answer-field/id #uuid "2afc926f-9cf1-5b4f-8748-f140b3012b4a" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-96e025f6-a797-5f53-bd93-ef33e6a27f03" :answer-field/choices ["answer-96e025f6-a797-5f53-bd93-ef33e6a27f03"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-96e025f6-a797-5f53-bd93-ef33e6a27f03" :answer/id #uuid "96e025f6-a797-5f53-bd93-ef33e6a27f03" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-8c3f231c-8d0c-511e-b4f9-0d81c5e6659f" :question/id #uuid "8c3f231c-8d0c-511e-b4f9-0d81c5e6659f" :question/math-academy-id "q-341863" :question/problem "$$\nf(x)∼\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi }{2}x)+{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi }{2}x)\n$$\n\nLet $F(x)=x+1$ for $x\\in [-2,2).$ The Fourier series of the $4$-periodic extension $f(x)$ of $F(x)$ is shown above. Find the exact value of ${a}_{2}.$\n\n${a}_{2}=$ {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "For the Fourier series of a $2L$-periodic function, the cosine coefficients are given by\n\n$$\n{a}_{n}=\\frac{1}{L}{\\int }_{-L}^{L}f(x)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi }{L}x)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nIn our case, $L=2$ and $f(x)=x+1$ for $x\\in [-2,2).$ So, substituting into the formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{2} & =\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{-2}^{2}(x+1)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{2\\pi }{2}x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{-2}^{2}(x+1)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi x)\\,\\text{d}x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe use the integration by parts: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=x+1\\, & ⇒\\,{u}^{′}=1 \\\\ {v}^{′}=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi x)\\, & ⇒\\,v=\\frac{1}{\\pi }\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi x)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{2} & =\\frac{1}{2}(uv\\,{|}_{-2}^{2}-{\\int }_{-2}^{2}v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\frac{1}{\\pi }{[(x+1)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi x)]}_{-2}^{2}-{\\int }_{-2}^{2}\\frac{1}{\\pi }\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi x)\\,\\text{d}x) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\frac{1}{\\pi }[3\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\pi )-(-1)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(-2\\pi )]-\\frac{1}{\\pi }\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{\\pi }){[\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi x)]}_{-2}^{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\frac{1}{\\pi }\\cdot 0+\\frac{1}{{\\pi }^{2}}[\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2\\pi )-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(-2\\pi )]) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{{\\pi }^{2}}(1-1) \\\\  & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-a7ebfbb0-eafe-5de9-be9a-5eb3748e9483"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-a7ebfbb0-eafe-5de9-be9a-5eb3748e9483" :answer-field/id #uuid "a7ebfbb0-eafe-5de9-be9a-5eb3748e9483" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-88ed5bbc-d47f-5994-8b20-ac726fec6a85" :answer-field/choices ["answer-88ed5bbc-d47f-5994-8b20-ac726fec6a85"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-88ed5bbc-d47f-5994-8b20-ac726fec6a85" :answer/id #uuid "88ed5bbc-d47f-5994-8b20-ac726fec6a85" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-46598e7e-81d3-578b-80cc-94d59f9707e8" :question/id #uuid "46598e7e-81d3-578b-80cc-94d59f9707e8" :question/math-academy-id "q-341861" :question/problem "$$\nf(x)∼\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(nx)+{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(nx)\n$$\n\nLet $F(x)=-4x$ for $x\\in [-\\pi ,\\pi ).$ The Fourier series of the $2\\pi $-periodic extension $f(x)$ of $F(x)$ is shown above. Find the exact value of ${b}_{2}.$\n\n${b}_{2}=$ {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "For the Fourier series of a $2L$-periodic function, the sine coefficients are given by\n\n$$\n{b}_{n}=\\frac{1}{L}{\\int }_{-L}^{L}f(x)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi }{L}x)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nIn our case, $L=\\pi $ and $f(x)=-4x$ for $x\\in (-\\pi ,\\pi ).$ So, substituting into the formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{b}_{2} & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }(-4x)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{2\\pi }{\\pi }x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }(-4x)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe use the integration by parts: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=-4x\\, & ⇒\\,{u}^{′}=-4 \\\\ {v}^{′}=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)\\, & ⇒\\,v=-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{b}_{2} & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }(uv\\,{|}_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }-{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }(-\\frac{1}{2}{[(-4x)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)]}_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }-{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }(-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x))(-4)\\,\\text{d}x) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }(-\\frac{1}{2}((-4\\pi )\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2\\pi )-(4\\pi )\\operatorname{cos}⁡(-2\\pi ))-2{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)\\,\\text{d}x) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }(-\\frac{1}{2}((-4\\pi )\\cdot 1-(4\\pi )\\cdot 1)-2\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}{[\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)]}_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }(4\\pi -(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\pi )-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(-2\\pi ))) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }\\cdot (4\\pi -0) \\\\  & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-6c30a88d-8e13-5d71-9185-007060f3d4e5"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-6c30a88d-8e13-5d71-9185-007060f3d4e5" :answer-field/id #uuid "6c30a88d-8e13-5d71-9185-007060f3d4e5" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-824395f4-e1d3-5e0f-879c-0d03e310d7a5" :answer-field/choices ["answer-824395f4-e1d3-5e0f-879c-0d03e310d7a5"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-824395f4-e1d3-5e0f-879c-0d03e310d7a5" :answer/id #uuid "824395f4-e1d3-5e0f-879c-0d03e310d7a5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]}] "assertions" [["question-903d90ff-4e96-59f7-912a-24572f1e9b78" :question/id #uuid "903d90ff-4e96-59f7-912a-24572f1e9b78"] ["question-903d90ff-4e96-59f7-912a-24572f1e9b78" :question/math-academy-id "q-341780"] ["question-903d90ff-4e96-59f7-912a-24572f1e9b78" :question/problem "Let $f(x)$ be the $2L$-periodic extension of a function $F(x)$ from $x\\in [-L,L)$ to $x\\in R.$\nSelect the correct options in the reasoning below.\n\nThe Fourier series of $f$ is given by\n\n$$\nf(x)∼\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡({{field-1}})+{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡({{field-2}}).\n$$\n\nThe $7$th sine coefficient of the series is\n\n$$\n{b}_{7}={{field-3}}.\n$$\n\nGiven that $F(x)=x$ and $L=2\\pi ,$ the $7$th sine coefficient becomes\n\n$$\n{b}_{7}={{field-4}}\\,\\cdot \\,{{field-5}}.\n$$"] ["question-903d90ff-4e96-59f7-912a-24572f1e9b78" :question/worked-solution "Recall that multiplying the argument of a function by $k\\ne 0$ represents the horizontal stretching of the corresponding graph by a factor of $\\frac{1}{k}.$\n\nNow, let $s=\\frac{\\pi }{L}x.$ Then, since $f(x)$ has a period of $2L,$ the function\n\n$$\ng(s)=f(\\frac{L}{\\pi }s)\n$$\n\nmust have a period of $2L\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{L}=2\\pi .$ \n\nThe Fourier series of $g(s)$ is\n\n$$\ng(s)∼\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(ns)+{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(ns),\n$$\n\nwhere:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{0} & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }g(s)\\,\\text{d}s \\\\ {a}_{n} & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }g(s)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(ns)\\,\\text{d}s,\\,n\\ge 1 \\\\ {b}_{n} & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }g(s)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(ns)\\,\\text{d}s,\\,n\\ge 1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting $s=\\frac{\\pi }{L}x$ and using the fact that $g(s)=f(\\frac{L}{\\pi }s),$ we get the Fourier series of $f(x):$\n\n$$\nf(x)∼\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi }{L}x)+{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi }{L}x)\n$$\n\nTherefore, $7$th sine coefficient of $f(x)$ is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{b}_{7} & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }g(s)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(7s)\\,\\text{d}s \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }f(\\frac{L}{\\pi }s)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(7s)\\,\\text{d}s \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-L}^{L}f(\\frac{L}{\\pi }\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{L}x)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(7\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{L}x)\\,\\text{d}(\\frac{\\pi }{L}x) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{L}{\\int }_{-L}^{L}f(x)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{L}x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{L}{\\int }_{-L}^{L}f(x)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{L}x)\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting $L=2\\pi $ and $f(x)=x,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{b}_{7} & =\\frac{1}{2\\pi }{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{2\\pi }x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2\\pi }\\cdot {\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{7}{2}x)\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-903d90ff-4e96-59f7-912a-24572f1e9b78" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-805880d3-7d18-5740-8087-2ae8c15c331c" :answer-field/id #uuid "805880d3-7d18-5740-8087-2ae8c15c331c"] ["answer-8dec1159-c016-57bc-8e49-76e49f3b73d9" :answer/id #uuid "8dec1159-c016-57bc-8e49-76e49f3b73d9"] ["answer-8dec1159-c016-57bc-8e49-76e49f3b73d9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-8dec1159-c016-57bc-8e49-76e49f3b73d9" :answer/value "\\frac{L}{n\\pi }x"] ["answer-4fd5f360-bb1c-5412-9c28-722c0c98fb87" :answer/id #uuid "4fd5f360-bb1c-5412-9c28-722c0c98fb87"] ["answer-4fd5f360-bb1c-5412-9c28-722c0c98fb87" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-4fd5f360-bb1c-5412-9c28-722c0c98fb87" :answer/value "\\frac{nL}{\\pi }x"] ["answer-81e348bd-fe6e-5550-9ceb-6c63b183128e" :answ